  "VB-2509":"A business mobile user has voice or signal but cannot use data, and AI tests device, subscription, APN, policy and mobile-network causes to restore connectivity without unnecessary escalation.",
  "VB-2510":"A customer’s primary broadband has failed but the 4G/5G resilience service has not taken over, so AI diagnoses the backup modem, SIM, authentication and failover policy before restoring resilience.",
  "VB-2511":"A legitimate business application is being blocked by security controls, and AI distinguishes genuine threat activity from an incorrect policy before proposing a safe, auditable exception or rollback.",
